cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use QHTM, please cite it as below."
title: "QHTM — Quantum Hardware Threat Matrix"
abstract: >-
  An open, defense-agnostic taxonomy of adversary techniques against quantum
  computing hardware and its classical control stack (QEC/syndrome-decoder
  pipeline, control/compilation stack, cross-tenant interactions, covert
  channels). Not post-quantum cryptography.
version: "1.2"
date-released: 2026-11-12
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Sipani
    given-names: Garrv
keywords:
  - quantum computing security
  - quantum hardware security
  - quantum error correction
  - threat taxonomy
  - control stack
